          "chunk_id": "s01_c01",
          "anchor_id": "cue_s01_c1_transformer_based_language_models_sh",
          "text": "Transformer-based language models show a striking ability called in-context learning, where a pretrained model solves brand-new tasks just by seeing a few input-output examples in its prompt, with no fine-tuning.",
          "expected_role": "method",
          "cue_keywords": [
