        {
          "chunk_index": 2,
          "chunk_id": "s01_c02",
          "anchor_id": "cue_s01_c2_but_why_produces_ability_how",
          "text": "But why training produces this ability, and how well it generalizes, has stayed mostly a mystery because the math of nonlinear attention and nonlinear activations is hard.",
