          "chunk_index": 3,
          "chunk_id": "s01_c03",
          "anchor_id": "cue_s01_c3_icml_2024_gives_first_theoretical",
          "text": "This ICML 2024 paper gives the first theoretical analysis of the training dynamics of a Transformer with both nonlinear self-attention and a nonlinear MLP, and proves when the trained model generalizes in-context, both in-domain and under distribution shift.",
          "expected_role": "method",
          "cue_keywords": [
