        {
          "chunk_index": 4,
          "chunk_id": "s01_c04",
          "anchor_id": "cue_s01_c4_also_delivers_first_theory_how",
          "text": "It also delivers the first theory of how pruning affects in-context learning, showing that removing the small-magnitude neurons barely hurts.",
          "expected_role": "content",
          "cue_keywords": [
