          "chunk_id": "s02_c03",
          "anchor_id": "cue_s02_c3_core_difficulty_technical_self_atten",
          "text": "The core difficulty is technical: the self-attention layer is nonlinear through the softmax, and the MLP is nonlinear through the ReLU activation, so the training problem is nonconvex and resists the tools used for simpler models.",
          "expected_role": "method",
          "cue_keywords": [
