          "anchor_id": "cue_s04_c2_first_first_theoretical_characteriza",
          "text": "First, it is the first theoretical characterization of how to train a Transformer that keeps both nonlinear self-attention and a nonlinear MLP, and it proves the trained model generalizes in context to unseen tasks, quantifying the required amount of data, number of iterations, and context length.",
