          "chunk_id": "s05_c03",
          "anchor_id": "cue_s05_c3_authors_follow_gradient_descent_dyna",
          "text": "The authors follow the gradient-descent dynamics of the query, key, value, and MLP weights, and evaluate the resulting model both in-domain and under a distribution shift where the test relevant patterns are linear combinations of the training ones.",
          "expected_role": "method",
          "cue_keywords": [
