          "chunk_id": "s05_c04",
          "anchor_id": "cue_s05_c4_two_quantities_drive_guarantees_alph",
          "text": "Two quantities drive the guarantees: alpha, the fraction of context examples that share the query's relevant pattern, and beta, the magnitude of the relevant features.",
