          "chunk_id": "s07_c01",
          "anchor_id": "cue_s07_c1_main_theorem_shows_number_iterations",
          "text": "The main theorem shows that a number of iterations, and a matching number of samples, that grow only polynomially in the problem parameters is enough to drive the in-domain generalization error down to order epsilon.",
