          "anchor_id": "cue_s07_c2_crucially_same_trained_also_generali",
          "text": "Crucially, the same trained model also generalizes out of domain to shifted tasks, as long as the new relevant patterns are linear combinations of the training patterns with coefficients summing to at least one.",
